  "known_boundary_note": "q_noise is a private witness with no range check and no binding to a seed. Choosing q_noise = target - q_clipped (or q_clipped = 0 and q_noise = q_noisy) satisfies both checks for any integer q_noisy, so the EZKL gate only rejects clients whose own witness is inconsistent; it does not bound the update. The Halo2 line generates bounded noise inside the circuit.",
